that says something like,

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:04.440
I watched this show with
my mom and it helped her

00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:05.610
understand me more.

00:03:05.610 --> 00:03:06.930
And I mean, that type of stuff, it's like

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:09.371
you can't even that's, it's like,

00:03:09.371 --> 00:03:11.850
it's not why one would get into acting,

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:13.440
because you can't even imagine it.

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:15.750
But to have something
like that happen is such

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:16.767
like icing on the cake it's really

00:03:16.767 --> 00:03:18.420
- [Kelly] But to move
people and to connect.

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:19.253
- [D'Arcy] Exactly. Yeah.

00:03:19.253 --> 00:03:20.760
- And to show empathy,
compassion, all those things,

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:22.350
that's what art is about.

00:03:22.350 --> 00:03:23.183
- [D'Arcy] Yeah.

00:03:23.183 --> 00:03:24.016
Yeah. For sure.

00:03:24.016 --> 00:03:26.057
- Congratulations on such an awesome role.

